name canoniclayout
category Package
revision 54758
shortdesc Create canonical page layouts with memoir
longdesc A canonic text layout has specified relations to a circle
longdesc inscribed within the enclosing page. The package allows the
longdesc user to use a canonic layout with the memoir class.
